// Description: Detects remote interactive logons (RDP sessions) originating from public IP addresses indicating potential unauthorized external access or credential compromise
// Data Source: DeviceLogonEvents
// Severity: High (Unauthorized Access / External Exposure)
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1021.001, T1110, T1078
// False Positives: Legitimate VPN access, authorized remote administration, IT support sessions from external networks

DeviceLogonEvents
| where RemoteIPType == "Public" and LogonType == "RemoteInteractive"
| project Timestamp, DeviceName, AccountName, RemoteIP
